					<h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-text-primary">We have a subscription too</h3>
					<p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Yes, Argon has a paid tier. The difference is we don't lock basic features behind it. Core communication — voice, text, screen sharing — works fully without paying. Premium is for extras like extended storage, cosmetics, and priority support.</p>
